    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d721-a2">

                <pb facs="0688" n="590" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg590"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">African Banking Corporation to Mr.
                    Geldart.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-01-19"><hi rendition="#italic">January 19,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: We beg to state that we negotiated for
                    you on August 23 last two bills, £75 9s. and £4 2s. 3d., drawn on Patlansky
                    Brothers, Johannesburg, for shipment of goods per steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maria</hi>. These bills fell due on October 28, and are
                    still unpaid.</p>
                <p>Yours, faithfully, for African Banking Corporation, Limited,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. J. Fraser-Campbell</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
